---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { atlas, atlasTotal, atlasPhilosophy } from '../../data/styleAtlas';
---

<Base
  title="스타일 좌표 도감 — jasonmoon.dev"
  description={`'고급스럽게' 같은 형용사 대신 ${atlasTotal}개의 구체적 좌표로 디자인 방향을 정하세요. 시대·기관·인쇄물을 고르면 디자인이 강제됩니다.`}
>
  <!-- ═══════════════ HERO ═══════════════ -->
  <section class="relative border-b border-border overflow-hidden">
    <div class="hud-hatch-dim absolute inset-0 opacity-60 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 sm:px-10 py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
        <span class="hud-id">ATLAS · {atlasTotal}</span>
        <span class="hud-pip hud-pip--amber"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-muted">Style Coordinate Atlas</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-3">
        스타일 좌표 도감
      </h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-text-faint mb-8">
        STYLE COORDINATE ATLAS
      </p>

      <!-- 좌표 공식 모노 박스 -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8 border border-border-strong bg-surface/60 hud-frame">
        <span class="hud-corner-bl"></span><span class="hud-corner-br"></span>
        <div class="px-5 sm:px-7 py-4">
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent mb-2">좌표 공식 · FORMULA</div>
          <p class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base text-text leading-relaxed break-keep">
            {atlasPhilosophy.formula}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="max-w-2xl text-text-muted leading-relaxed break-keep mb-8">
        '고급스럽게' 같은 형용사는 축 하나만 정합니다.
        <span class="text-text">'이 시대·이 기관·이 인쇄물처럼'</span>을 고르면 디자인이 정확히 정해집니다.
        마음에 드는 좌표를 골라 카톡으로 보내주세요.
      </p>

      <!-- litmus · layering 인용 -->
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 max-w-3xl">
        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-accent/50 pl-4 py-1">
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent/80 mb-1">리트머스</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed break-keep">{atlasPhilosophy.litmus}</p>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-cyan/40 pl-4 py-1">
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan/80 mb-1">겹쳐쓰기</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed break-keep">{atlasPhilosophy.layering}</p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- 믹스 안내 배너 -->
      <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl border border-accent/40 bg-accent-dim px-5 py-4">
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-text leading-relaxed break-keep">
          💡 <b class="text-accent">하나만 고르지 않으셔도 돼요.</b>
          마음에 드는 스타일을 <b class="text-accent">2개·3개 이상 섞어</b> 달라고 하셔도 됩니다.
          예) "1970년대 대학원 핸드아웃 + 터미널 화면 분위기"처럼요 —
          섞을수록 더 독특하고 우리 가게만의 디자인이 나옵니다.
          <br/><b class="text-text">잘 모르시겠으면 그냥 느낌만 말씀해 주셔도 됩니다 — 3가지 시안으로 제안드립니다.</b>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════ 카테고리 네비 ═══════════════ -->
  <nav
    aria-label="카테고리"
    class="sticky top-0 z-30 border-b border-border bg-bg/85 backdrop-blur-md"
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-10">
      <div class="flex gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto py-3 no-scrollbar">
        {atlas.map((cat) => (
          <a
            href={`#${cat.key}`}
            class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs px-3 py-1.5 border border-border bg-surface/60 text-text-muted hover:text-accent hover:border-accent transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
          >
            {cat.label}
            <span class="text-text-faint ml-1">{cat.styles.length}</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ═══════════════ 카테고리 섹션 ═══════════════ -->
  {atlas.map((cat) => (
    <section id={cat.key} class="scroll-mt-16 border-b border-border">
      <!-- 섹션 헤더 -->
      <div class="px-6 sm:px-10 py-4 border-b border-border bg-surface/40 flex items-center gap-3 sticky top-[49px] z-20 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <span class="hud-id">{cat.label}</span>
        <span class="reg-mark text-accent/60"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-text-faint">
          {cat.styles.length} 좌표
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- 좌표 카드 그리드 -->
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-10 py-8">
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4">
          {cat.styles.map((s) => (
            <article class="group relative flex border border-border bg-surface/50 hover:border-accent transition-colors duration-200 overflow-hidden">
              <!-- 좌표가 강제하는 색 띠 -->
              <span class="w-1 shrink-0" style={`background:${s.color}`} aria-hidden="true"></span>

              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 px-4 py-4">
                <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[15px] leading-snug text-text break-keep mb-1">
                  {s.ko}
                </h3>
                <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-text-faint tracking-wide mb-2.5 truncate">
                  {s.en}
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed break-keep italic">
                  {s.motif}
                </p>

                {s.sample && (
                  <a
                    href={`/portfolio/${s.sample}`}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener"
                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-accent hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors"
                  >
                    예시 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                  </a>
                )}
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  ))}

  <!-- ═══════════════ CTA ═══════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="hud-hatch absolute inset-0 opacity-50 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28 text-center">
      <span class="hud-id mb-6 inline-block">FREE · 무료</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight mb-4 break-keep">
        이 좌표로 만들어 드립니다. <span class="text-accent">무료.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed break-keep mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        마음에 드는 좌표(또는 둘을 겹친 조합)를 골라 카톡으로 보내주세요.
        형용사가 아니라 좌표로 말하면, 결과물이 정확히 같은 방향으로 나옵니다.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://invite.kakao.com/tc/EszOu7fY0i"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 border-2 border-accent bg-accent text-black px-6 py-3.5 font-bold tracking-tight hover:bg-accent-hover hover:scale-[1.03] transition-all duration-200 shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(255,176,0,0.4)]"
        >
          <span>💬 카톡으로 좌표 보내기</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/portfolio"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border-strong bg-surface text-text px-6 py-3.5 font-mono text-sm hover:border-accent hover:text-accent transition-colors"
        >
          포트폴리오 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .no-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }
</style>
